WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.470
Welcome back, champ!

2
00:00:06.470 --> 00:00:16.350
Last time: Start · Move · Wait · Say

3
00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:20.270
Chapter 2 · Making a Character Move

4
00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:32.090
Walk, and turn corners!

5
00:00:32.090 --> 00:00:44.660
Billu is hungry!

6
00:00:44.660 --> 00:00:54.260
Walk → turn the corner → walk

7
00:00:54.260 --> 00:01:08.120
Which blocks get Billu there? Think!

8
00:01:08.120 --> 00:01:13.840
First: an EVENT block

9
00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:28.230
Event = starts when something happens

10
00:01:28.230 --> 00:01:38.200
when green flag clicked · always on top

11
00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:47.460
Motion block: move 10 steps

12
00:01:47.460 --> 00:01:56.330
Steps = how far Billu goes

13
00:01:56.330 --> 00:02:03.690
move 20 = twice as far as move 10

14
00:02:03.690 --> 00:02:11.650
Motion block: turn 90 degrees

15
00:02:11.650 --> 00:02:21.050
90 degrees = a quarter turn, like a corner

16
00:02:21.050 --> 00:02:38.380
One turn → facing a new way

17
00:02:38.380 --> 00:02:44.300
1 turn: a corner

18
00:02:44.300 --> 00:02:50.460
2 turns: facing the other way!

19
00:02:50.460 --> 00:02:58.380
4 turns: back where he started

20
00:02:58.380 --> 00:03:05.670
Tip: start small · move 10 · turn 90

21
00:03:05.670 --> 00:03:17.640
move 1000? Zoom, off the screen!

22
00:03:17.640 --> 00:03:25.530
Small steps are easy to check

23
00:03:25.530 --> 00:03:43.280
Flag → Move 10 → Turn 90 → Move 10

24
00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:51.330
Walk, turn, walk… milk time!

25
00:03:51.330 --> 00:04:03.190
Event on top, motion blocks below

26
00:04:03.190 --> 00:04:17.420
Try · Watch · Change one block

27
00:04:17.420 --> 00:04:23.380
Try: click the green flag

28
00:04:23.380 --> 00:04:32.740
Watch: he turned too early!

29
00:04:32.740 --> 00:04:48.200
Change one: move 10 → move 20

30
00:04:48.200 --> 00:04:55.500
One change at a time, so you know what worked

31
00:04:55.500 --> 00:05:10.030
To go straight, which block comes out?

32
00:05:10.030 --> 00:05:22.410
Take out turn 90 → straight ahead!

33
00:05:22.410 --> 00:05:26.110
Your turn: practice check

34
00:05:26.110 --> 00:05:35.420
Face the other way: how many 90° turns?

35
00:05:35.420 --> 00:05:50.970
Two! 2 quarter turns = a half turn

36
00:05:50.970 --> 00:05:56.820
Event on top: when green flag clicked

37
00:05:56.820 --> 00:06:02.580
Motion: move 10 steps · turn 90 degrees

38
00:06:02.580 --> 00:06:08.180
Two 90° turns = face the other way

39
00:06:08.180 --> 00:06:12.780
Try · Watch · Change one block

40
00:06:12.780 --> 00:06:19.380
Chapter 2 done!

41
00:06:19.380 --> 00:06:24.290
Next: Quiz · Tap Finish
